 "▼ Dive in: <0>Turn by turn</0>": "",
 "Each loop iteration is a <0>fresh model call over the whole context so far</0>. The model has no hidden state between calls; the context <1>is</1> the memory.": "",
 "Every tool call and result is appended, so the context (and the input-token bill) grows turn by turn.": "",
 "Token counts here use a rough chars/{#} estimate on the actual JSON shown. Real tokenizers differ.": "",
 "Because the same prefix is re-sent each turn, prompt caching can cut the cost of the repeated part considerably.": "",
