 "Only the grey-matter steps (model, logits) are neural. Template, sampler, parser, tool and append are ordinary code.": "",
 "Inner loop: <0>autoregressive generation</0>. Outer loop: this section.": "",
 "▼ Dive in: <0>Each hop</0>": "",
 "The agent is a <0>loop around repeated next-token prediction</0>. Text becomes token IDs, the model produces logits, a sampler picks tokens, and those tokens <1>happen to spell</1> a JSON tool call.": "",
 "The harness is <0>ordinary code</0>: it parses that JSON, calls a real function, and turns the result back into tokens for the next prediction.": "",
 "There are two nested loops: the inner one (one token per forward pass) and the outer agent loop (one tool round-trip per iteration).": "",
 "The tool-call syntax is trained into the model; formats differ per provider, but the principle is the same.": "",
